From 7011e048185a2f94c9b741125bb47adf57b9bea1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Junod <donujp@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 01:50:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] packaging: prepare structured extension status as hdr5

Regenerate the focused quilt patch and document scoped extension failures, preserved base diagnostics and architecture-specific LTO policy. The fifth additive symbol has the hdr5 minimum; the development package continues to require its exact matching runtime. Earlier hdr3 and hdr4 artifacts remain historical candidates.
---
 debian/README.native-displayid            |  22 +-
 debian/changelog                          |  11 +
 debian/patches/native-displayid-hdr.patch | 375 +++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 393 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

